# ProjectManager

Help teams organize and execute work.

## Entity Project: id: ID, name: Text, status: draft | active | archived
## Entity Task: id: ID, title: Text, done: Bool
## Capability createProject `capability.createProject`
- requires: ['permission.project.create']
- mutates: []
- emits: ['event.projectCreated']
## Capability archiveProject `capability.archiveProject`
- requires: ['permission.project.archive']
- mutates: ['field.project.status']
- emits: ['event.projectArchived']
## Surface Dashboard `surface.dashboard` — components ['component.dashboard.sidebar', 'component.dashboard.main', 'component.dashboard.header', 'component.dashboard.projectList', 'component.dashboard.createProjectButton']
## Surface ProjectDetail `surface.projectDetail` — components ['component.dashboard.header', 'component.projectDetail.projectOverview', 'component.projectDetail.taskList', 'component.projectDetail.archiveButton']
## Surface CreateProject `surface.createProject` — components ['component.projectForm', 'component.createProject.submitButton']
## Flow CreateProject `flow.createProject` — actor actor.member, goal goal.createProject